  "description": "Wanderosa C Apex Eagle is a full-suspension ebike built for otherworldly gravel adventures. Its carbon fiber frame, 120mm front and 110mm rear suspension travel, and 29 x 2.2″ tires offer a hover-bike feel over harsh terrain.\n\nThe FAZUA Ride 60 drive unit gives you the boost to explore more side roads and stay in the saddle on the steepest climbs. Wanderosa’s progressive gravel geometry puts you in a comfortable, confident position for whatever your route has in store, and on-bike cargo keeps you equipped for those far-out journeys.\n\nThe SRAM Apex Eagle components get shifting duties done without drama, rounding out a full-suspension ebike made to wander the gravel roads you love or have yet to discover.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
